WEBVTT

00:04:58.586 --> 00:05:00.588
But here's something to think about.

00:05:01.422 --> 00:05:04.091
If you are in America or Europe,

00:05:04.133 --> 00:05:08.429
you think it's kind of normal to say
that your dog is part of your family.

00:05:09.597 --> 00:05:11.307
I can tell you, though,

00:05:11.349 --> 00:05:14.727
that if you’re sitting in Tajikistan
or most other cultures

00:05:14.769 --> 00:05:16.270
which are non-Western,

00:05:16.312 --> 00:05:21.734
saying that a dog is part of your family
makes you look really weird.

00:05:21.734 --> 00:05:22.943
(Laughter)

00:05:22.985 --> 00:05:24.111
If not exotic.

00:05:24.487 --> 00:05:25.654
(Laughter)

00:05:25.696 --> 00:05:29.700
Because the reality is that in many
cultures throughout history,

00:05:29.742 --> 00:05:33.454
animals have been defined
in opposition to humans.